{"OptimizedCursorPaginator slices querysets using a negative start offset when enable_advanced_features is enabled and cursor.offset < 0, and Cursor.from_string accepts negative offsets from user input, bypassing negative-offset validation and causing unhandled exceptions (500) instead of controlled 400 errors": 0.958362877368927, "OptimizedCursorPaginator.get_item_key applies math.floor/ceil to the raw model field value, but OrganizationAuditLogsEndpoint uses it with order_by=\"-datetime\" where the field is a datetime, causing a TypeError during cursor generation and a 500 response when optimized_pagination=true": 0.9444000720977783, "OrganizationAuditLogsEndpoint computes enable_advanced using organization_context.member.has_global_access without checking member is present, and RpcUserOrganizationContext.member can be None (e.g., request.auth-based access), causing AttributeError and a 500 even when optimized_pagination is not requested": 0.943988025188446}